CREATED:20260420T141640Z
DESCRIPTION:Lunch and Learn with Kelli Luginbuhl\, PhD '17\, Biomedical En
 gineering\n \nKelli will share details about her journey from PhD to foun
 der\, and CSO to CEO to General Manager\, including what it was like to l
 ead teams through high-pressure\, high-growth phases of innovative produc
 t launch in both startup and corporate environments. A big part of her su
 ccess included building high performing teams. She will share tips for gr
 aduate students on what can set you apart in a pool of applicants\, how t
 o consider your own strengths in choosing a professional path\, and what 
 skills she wishes she had developed before leaving Duke.\n \nKelli now se
 rves on the board of directors for a startup\, directs the I&E PhD Innova
 tors Program at Duke\, and serves as a Founder-in-Residence for the NC Ce
 nter for Entrepreneurial Development. \n \nBoxed lunch provided. Please R
 SVP.
DURATION:PT1H
DTSTAMP:20260420T161327Z
