CREATED:20260422T152250Z
DESCRIPTION:Dr. Guarino will discuss her research investigating the role o
 f corticotropin-releasing factor (CRF) neurocircuitry in the modulation o
 f binge-like ethanol consumption. Specifically\, she will discuss her wor
 k combining transgenic mice\, chemogenetic tools\, and drinking in the da
 rk (DID) procedures to explore CRF+ neural pathways arising from the LH a
 nd innervating efferent projection regions\, including the ventral tegmen
 tal area (VTA)\, known to regulate stress and reward systems.
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260507T130000
