DESCRIPTION:Open House at the Duke Teaching Observatory is a chance to loo
 k at the beautiful night sky with some 10" telescopes guided by Duke phys
 icists.\nFree event\, everyone is welcome\, no reservations are required!
  Check the weather beforehand and dress appropriately for spending time o
 utdoors in the woods. \n\nFor more details and last minute weather cancel
 lation updates see\nhttps://physics.duke.edu/duke-teaching-observatory
