CREATED:20260423T143716Z
DESCRIPTION:The Department of Chemistry looks forward to celebrating with 
 our graduates on Sunday\, May 10. The Ceremony for undergraduate and grad
 uate degrees will begin at 12.15pm in Gross Hall Room 107. A light lunch 
 will be available at the French Science Center beginning at 11.00am. \nTh
 is will be a ticketed event with each graduate eligible for up to four (4
 ) tickets. Should you have additional guests joining\, family and friends
  are welcome to gather in Gross Hall 103 for a livestream viewing.\nWe lo
 ok forward to celebrating this important milestone with our graduates!
DURATION:PT1H
DTSTAMP:20260423T143716Z
